Subject: [M152] Guard against reentrancy in OnPageVisibilityChanged

Original change's description:
> Guard against reentrancy in OnPageVisibilityChanged
>
> OnPageShown() and OnPageHidden() can synchronously run script (e.g. via
> text-track cue updates) that removes the frame and destroys the
> RendererWebMediaPlayerDelegate. Snapshot player IDs before iterating and
> check a WeakPtr after each observer notification.
>
> Fixed: 570675082
> Change-Id: I5e784dcd7bb779fa689ba832ae683de827f62792
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8526472
> Reviewed-by: Frank Liberato <liberato@chromium.org>
> Auto-Submit: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
> Commit-Queue: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
> Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1713842}

